$MDESC::Type = "GoldenEye007";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other inside the Grid " @
         "\n\n<f1>OHMSS Briefing: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Honestly 007 ol chap I am not sure how you ended up here your location on radar is a perfect dark. " @
         "\n\n<f0>Take care 007 and be certain to use the bomb defuser correctly. " @
         "\n\n<f0>Whatever part in whatever building you seem to be in is very high up." @
         "\n\n<f2>Hardly a lovers leap James. Be careful though I hate to think of you falling for anyone else.";